<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_win32_service_exception">Win32ServiceException</link></para>

<para>This class represents exceptions thrown by Win32 service operations. It extends the base Exception class to provide specific error handling for Win32 service functions. </para>
